OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK consider ditching
OL,4,A'sanctuary' status
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK leaders in Bradford have
OL,7,Fproposed pulling out of a network of
OL,8,Fcouncils which aim to create safe and
OL,9,Fwelcoming communities for refugees and
OL,10,Fasylum seekers.
OL,12,FBradford was awarded Local Authority of
OL,13,FSanctuary status in 2021, meaning it
OL,14,Fguides refugees and people seeking
OL,15,Fsanctuary to services including English
OL,16,Fclasses, and hosts events for refugees.
OL,18,FReform said its plans to ditch the
OL,19,Fstatus "may upset oversensitive
OL,20,Fpolitical opponents but are firmly in
OL,21,Fthe public interest."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
