OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK consider ditching
OL,4,A'sanctuary' status
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition leaders have criticised the
OL,7,Fproposal as "vice signalling" and
OL,8,F"political posturing" that "would not
OL,9,Ffix a single service for a single
OL,10,Fresident."
